 transition hover:opacity-90 focus-visible:outline-white\" href=\"/blog/first-person-video-robot-learning\">Read the field note <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></article></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 pb-24 sm:px-8 sm:pb-32 lg:px-12 xl:px-16\"><div class=\"mb-9 flex items-end justify-between gap-6\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--primary)]\">Archive</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-heading text-3xl tracking-[-0.035em] sm:text-4xl\">Latest observations</h2></div><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">21<!-- --> entries</span></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" href=\"/blog/agents-that-pay-humans-that-teach\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-80 grayscale-[20%] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.035] group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fagents-that-pay-humans-that-teach-cover.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fagents-that-pay-humans-that-teach-cover.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fagents-that-pay-humans-that-teach-cover.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fagents-that-pay-humans-that-teach-cover.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fagents-that-pay-humans-that-teach-cover.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fagents-that-pay-humans-that-teach-cover.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fagents-that-pay-humans-that-teach-cover.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fagents-that-pay-humans-that-teach-cover.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fagents-that-pay-humans-that-teach-cover.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fagents-that-pay-humans-that-teach-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fagents-that-pay-humans-that-teach-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--surface)]/70 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></a><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)]\">Robotics</span><time dateTime=\"2026-11-20\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Nov 20, 2026</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[1.55rem] leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[1.7rem]\"><a class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog/agents-that-pay-humans-that-teach\">Agents That Pay, Humans That Teach.</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Agentic finance and egocentric data are the twin infrastructures of embodied AI — one lets autonomous agents transact at machine speed, the other lets them learn from human physical experience. Neither works alone; together they describe the architectural floor of Physical AI.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>14 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read Agents That Pay, Humans That Teach.\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/agents-that-pay-humans-that-teach\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" href=\"/blog/closing-the-loop-on-physical-ai\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-80 grayscale-[20%] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.035] group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fclosing-the-loop-on-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fclosing-the-loop-on-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fclosing-the-loop-on-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fclosing-the-loop-on-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fclosing-the-loop-on-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fclosing-the-loop-on-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fclosing-the-loop-on-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fclosing-the-loop-on-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fclosing-the-loop-on-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fclosing-the-loop-on-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fclosing-the-loop-on-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--surface)]/70 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></a><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)]\">Robotics</span><time dateTime=\"2026-11-20\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Nov 20, 2026</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[1.55rem] leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[1.7rem]\"><a class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog/closing-the-loop-on-physical-ai\">Closing the Loop on Physical AI</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">First-person robot training data and autonomous stablecoin settlement are converging into a single closed loop for embodied intelligence — closing the distribution gap between training viewpoints and real-world deployment.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>12 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read Closing the Loop on Physical AI\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/closing-the-loop-on-physical-ai\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" href=\"/blog/from-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-80 grayscale-[20%] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.035] group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Ffrom-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor-cover.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Ffrom-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor-cover.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Ffrom-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor-cover.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Ffrom-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor-cover.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Ffrom-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor-cover.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Ffrom-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor-cover.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Ffrom-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor-cover.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Ffrom-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor-cover.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Ffrom-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor-cover.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Ffrom-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Ffrom-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--surface)]/70 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></a><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)]\">Robotics</span><time dateTime=\"2026-11-20\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Nov 20, 2026</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[1.55rem] leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[1.7rem]\"><a class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog/from-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor\">From Hobby Cam to Registered Data Vendor</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Agentic commerce is getting serious infrastructure — programmable stablecoin settlement, one-purchase credentials, multi-rail access. The creator economy has a proven playbook. Both trends converge on the contributor: recording real-world tasks is becoming a paid profession with agents as its buyers.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>11 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read From Hobby Cam to Registered Data Vendor\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/from-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" href=\"/blog/human-experience-starts-scaling-globally\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-80 grayscale-[20%] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.035] group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fhuman-experience-starts-scaling-globally-cover.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fhuman-experience-starts-scaling-globally-cover.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fhuman-experience-starts-scaling-globally-cover.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fhuman-experience-starts-scaling-globally-cover.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fhuman-experience-starts-scaling-globally-cover.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fhuman-experience-starts-scaling-globally-cover.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fhuman-experience-starts-scaling-globally-cover.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fhuman-experience-starts-scaling-globally-cover.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fhuman-experience-starts-scaling-globally-cover.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fhuman-experience-starts-scaling-globally-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fhuman-experience-starts-scaling-globally-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--surface)]/70 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></a><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)]\">Robotics</span><time dateTime=\"2026-11-20\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Nov 20, 2026</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[1.55rem] leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[1.7rem]\"><a class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog/human-experience-starts-scaling-globally\">Human Experience Starts Scaling Globally</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">A collaborative dataset of over 1,300 hours of egocentric demonstrations from 2,000 contributors proves robot learning data can scale globally. Combined with information-theoretic compression and agentic payment rails, this sketches the full pipeline of the experience economy: global capture, information-priced tokens, and machine-speed settlement.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>11 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read Human Experience Starts Scaling Globally\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/human-experience-starts-scaling-globally\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" href=\"/blog/one-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-80 grayscale-[20%] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.035] group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fone-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data-cover.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fone-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data-cover.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fone-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data-cover.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fone-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data-cover.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fone-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data-cover.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fone-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data-cover.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fone-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data-cover.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fone-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data-cover.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fone-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data-cover.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fone-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fone-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--surface)]/70 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></a><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)]\">Robotics</span><time dateTime=\"2026-11-20\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Nov 20, 2026</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[1.55rem] leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[1.7rem]\"><a class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog/one-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data\">One Scan, Many Robots: Pay-Per-Frame Data</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">A new gold standard in physical AI research shows that capturing a real environment once can be repurposed endlessly into simulation environments, robot trajectories, and training data. Stablecoin micropayments remove the fee floor, making per-request data commerce viable.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>12 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read One Scan, Many Robots: Pay-Per-Frame Data\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/one-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" href=\"/blog/pay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-80 grayscale-[20%] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.035] group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fpay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine-cover.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fpay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine-cover.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fpay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine-cover.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fpay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine-cover.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fpay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine-cover.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fpay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine-cover.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fpay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine-cover.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fpay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine-cover.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fpay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine-cover.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fpay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fpay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--surface)]/70 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></a><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)]\">Robotics</span><time dateTime=\"2026-11-20\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Nov 20, 2026</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[1.55rem] leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[1.7rem]\"><a class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog/pay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine\">Pay for Pixels That Surprise the Machine</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">A new video tokenizer brings Shannon&#x27;s information theory to robotics data — spending tokens only where content is unpredictable. This yields a pricing revolution: data billed by information content, not by the hour. Rare, surprising moments cost more and are worth more.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>12 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read Pay for Pixels That Surprise the Machine\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/pay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" href=\"/blog/real-world-data-meets-onchain-agent-payments\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-80 grayscale-[20%] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.035] group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Freal-world-data-meets-onchain-agent-payments-cover.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Freal-world-data-meets-onchain-agent-payments-cover.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Freal-world-data-meets-onchain-agent-payments-cover.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Freal-world-data-meets-onchain-agent-payments-cover.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Freal-world-data-meets-onchain-agent-payments-cover.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Freal-world-data-meets-onchain-agent-payments-cover.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Freal-world-data-meets-onchain-agent-payments-cover.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Freal-world-data-meets-onchain-agent-payments-cover.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Freal-world-data-meets-onchain-agent-payments-cover.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Freal-world-data-meets-onchain-agent-payments-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Freal-world-data-meets-onchain-agent-payments-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--surface)]/70 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></a><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)]\">Robotics</span><time dateTime=\"2026-11-20\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Nov 20, 2026</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[1.55rem] leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[1.7rem]\"><a class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog/real-world-data-meets-onchain-agent-payments\">Real-World Data Meets Onchain Agent Payments</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Physical AI needs rights-cleared first-person data captured in real environments. Agentic commerce needs an HTTP-native payment standard that settles onchain in sub-seconds. DigiRobotics composes ZenO/Story data provenance with x402 on Algorand into a single closed loop where contributors earn USDG instantly.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>12 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read Real-World Data Meets Onchain Agent Payments\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/real-world-data-meets-onchain-agent-payments\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" 