ext/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Frobots-that-see-and-pay-for-world-data-cover.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Frobots-that-see-and-pay-for-world-data-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Frobots-that-see-and-pay-for-world-data-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--surface)]/70 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></a><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)]\">Robotics</span><time dateTime=\"2026-11-20\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Nov 20, 2026</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[1.55rem] leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[1.7rem]\"><a class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog/robots-that-see-and-pay-for-world-data\">Robots That See and Pay for World Data</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Third-person training data fails robots because they never see from their own eyes. Egocentric first-person datasets close the perception-action gap, and stablecoin micropayments make machine-payable data commerce viable — together forming a marketplace where robots buy verified first-person training data.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>11 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read Robots That See and Pay for World Data\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/robots-that-see-and-pay-for-world-data\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" href=\"/blog/smart-glasses-and-the-token-economy\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-80 grayscale-[20%] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.035] group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fsmart-glasses-and-the-token-economy-cover.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fsmart-glasses-and-the-token-economy-cover.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fsmart-glasses-and-the-token-economy-cover.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fsmart-glasses-and-the-token-economy-cover.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fsmart-glasses-and-the-token-economy-cover.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fsmart-glasses-and-the-token-economy-cover.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fsmart-glasses-and-the-token-economy-cover.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fsmart-glasses-and-the-token-economy-cover.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fsmart-glasses-and-the-token-economy-cover.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fsmart-glasses-and-the-token-economy-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fsmart-glasses-and-the-token-economy-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--surface)]/70 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></a><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)]\">Robotics</span><time dateTime=\"2026-11-20\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Nov 20, 2026</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[1.55rem] leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[1.7rem]\"><a class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog/smart-glasses-and-the-token-economy\">Smart Glasses and the Token Economy</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">New research shows robots can learn manipulation skills purely from smart glasses video — no robot needed during collection. Combined with audio tokenization advances, first-person experience compresses into discrete, licensable, payable experience tokens — the unit of currency for embodied AI.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>12 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read Smart Glasses and the Token Economy\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/smart-glasses-and-the-token-economy\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" href=\"/blog/the-ai-data-compensation-crisis\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-80 grayscale-[20%] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.035] group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-ai-data-compensation-crisis-cover.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-ai-data-compensation-crisis-cover.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-ai-data-compensation-crisis-cover.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-ai-data-compensation-crisis-cover.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-ai-data-compensation-crisis-cover.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-ai-data-compensation-crisis-cover.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-ai-data-compensation-crisis-cover.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-ai-data-compensation-crisis-cover.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-ai-data-compensation-crisis-cover.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-ai-data-compensation-crisis-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-ai-data-compensation-crisis-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--surface)]/70 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></a><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)]\">Robotics</span><time dateTime=\"2026-11-20\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Nov 20, 2026</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[1.55rem] leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[1.7rem]\"><a class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog/the-ai-data-compensation-crisis\">The AI Data Compensation Crisis</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Only 7 of 24 major AI training data deals from 2020–2025 compensate original creators. Combining the Content ARCs rights framework with autonomous stablecoin settlement closes the loop — every access pays the rightsholder instantly.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>12 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read The AI Data Compensation Crisis\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/the-ai-data-compensation-crisis\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" href=\"/blog/the-contributor-economy-behind-embodied-ai\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-80 grayscale-[20%] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.035] group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-contributor-economy-behind-embodied-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-contributor-economy-behind-embodied-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-contributor-economy-behind-embodied-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-contributor-economy-behind-embodied-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-contributor-economy-behind-embodied-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-contributor-economy-behind-embodied-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-contributor-economy-behind-embodied-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-contributor-economy-behind-embodied-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-contributor-economy-behind-embodied-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-contributor-economy-behind-embodied-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-contributor-economy-behind-embodied-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--surface)]/70 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></a><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)]\">Robotics</span><time dateTime=\"2026-11-20\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Nov 20, 2026</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[1.55rem] leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[1.7rem]\"><a class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog/the-contributor-economy-behind-embodied-ai\">The Contributor Economy Behind Embodied AI</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Production-scale first-person data collection and autonomous stablecoin settlement are creating a new economic category — paid human contribution to Physical AI training at planetary scale, where everyday humans earn instantly when their footage trains robot policies.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>12 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read The Contributor Economy Behind Embodied AI\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/the-contributor-economy-behind-embodied-ai\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" href=\"/blog/the-data-supply-chain-gets-a-price-tag\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-80 grayscale-[20%] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.035] group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-data-supply-chain-gets-a-price-tag-cover.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-data-supply-chain-gets-a-price-tag-cover.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-data-supply-chain-gets-a-price-tag-cover.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-data-supply-chain-gets-a-price-tag-cover.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-data-supply-chain-gets-a-price-tag-cover.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-data-supply-chain-gets-a-price-tag-cover.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-data-supply-chain-gets-a-price-tag-cover.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-data-supply-chain-gets-a-price-tag-cover.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-data-supply-chain-gets-a-price-tag-cover.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-data-supply-chain-gets-a-price-tag-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-data-supply-chain-gets-a-price-tag-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--surface)]/70 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></a><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)]\">Robotics</span><time dateTime=\"2026-11-20\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Nov 20, 2026</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[1.55rem] leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[1.7rem]\"><a class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog/the-data-supply-chain-gets-a-price-tag\">The Data Supply Chain Gets a Price Tag</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Robotics data cannot be scraped — it must be physically captured. Stablecoin micropayments remove the fee floor, enabling an open, machine-payable marketplace where verified data is bought by the capture, not by the contract.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>12 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read The Data Supply Chain Gets a Price Tag\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/the-data-supply-chain-gets-a-price-tag\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" href=\"/blog/the-new-standard-for-robot-learning\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-80 grayscale-[20%] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.035] group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-new-standard-for-robot-learning-cover.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-new-standard-for-robot-learning-cover.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-new-standard-for-robot-learning-cover.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-new-standard-for-robot-learning-cover.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-new-standard-for-robot-learning-cover.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-new-standard-for-robot-learning-cover.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-new-standard-for-robot-learning-cover.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-new-standard-for-robot-learning-cover.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-new-standard-for-robot-learning-cover.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-new-standard-for-robot-learning-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-new-standard-for-robot-learning-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--surface)]/70 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></a><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)]\">Robotics</span><time dateTime=\"2026-11-20\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Nov 20, 2026</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[1.55rem] leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[1.7rem]\"><a class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog/the-new-standard-for-robot-learning\">The New Standard for Robot Learning</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">First-person training data and autonomous stablecoin settlement are becoming the foundation of embodied intelligence — the new standard in robot learning requires egocentric datasets at scale and a payment rail that can pay thousands of contributors instantly.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>11 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read The New Standard for Robot Learning\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/the-new-standard-for-robot-learning\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" href=\"/blog/the-productivity-shift-in-physical-ai\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-80 grayscale-[20%] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.035] group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-productivity-shift-in-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-productivity-shift-in-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-productivity-shift-in-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-productivity-shift-in-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-productivity-shift-in-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-productivity-shift-in-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-productivity-shift-in-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-productivity-shift-in-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-productivity-shift-in-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-productivity-shift-in-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-productivity-shift-in-physical-ai-cover.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--surface)]/70 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></a><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)]\">Robotics</span><time dateTime=\"2026-11-20\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Nov 20, 2026</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[1.55rem] leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[1.7rem]\"><a class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog/the-productivity-shift-in-physical-ai\">The Productivity Shift in Physical AI</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">AI agents have crossed from personality-driven experiments to productivity-driven autonomous systems — and egocentric capture has made the same jump from research curiosity to production-grade workflow. Both transitions demand the same settlement infrastructure: autonomous, instant, programmatically governed stablecoin payments.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>11 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read The Productivity Shift in Physical AI\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/the-productivity-shift-in-physical-ai\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" href=\"/blog/the-robotics-boom-needs-a-content-engine\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-80 grayscale-[20%] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.035] group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;