Market</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">The robotics training data market is fragmented and trust-starved. DigiRobotics is building a stablecoin-native exchange where provenance, confirmation gates, and layered security make data verifiable before agents ever click buy.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>14 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read Trust Rails for the Robot Data Market\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/trust-rails-for-the-robot-data-market\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" href=\"/blog/twin-stack-physical-ai-agentic-payments\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-80 grayscale-[20%] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.035] group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Ftwin-stack-cover.jpg&amp;w=256