e-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] group-hover:bg-[var(--primary)] group-hover:text-[var(--page-bg)]\" href=\"/blog/twin-stack-physical-ai-agentic-payments\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-[var(--surface)] transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/45 hover:shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_oklch(from_var(--primary)_l_c_h_/_45%)]\"><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)]\">x402</span><time dateTime=\"2026-09-24\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Sep 24, 2026</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[1.55rem] leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white sm:text-[1.7rem]\"><a class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog/http-402-agentic-data-commerce\">HTTP 402 as a machine-readable buying interface</a></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">How an agent can discover a protected resource, evaluate its payment terms, and request access without turning policy over to the model.</p><div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-7 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><span>7 min read</span><a aria-label=\"Read HTTP 402 as a machine-readable buying interface\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--primary)] gr